  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_0925.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(22 fotos) Druida bar&amp;drincs, al carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda, ha acollit la vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres l&#39;actuaci&oacute; del trio musical Romer, dins del cicle Gresca. Tamb&eacute; s&#39;ha aprofitat per a presentar la cervesa artesanal de Castell&oacute; Issan Beer, acompanyada de coques t&iacute;piques onderes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0912.jpg\" alt=\"img_0912\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0914.jpg\" alt=\"img_0914\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0915.jpg\" alt=\"img_0915\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0916.jpg\" alt=\"img_0916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0918.jpg\" alt=\"img_0918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0919.jpg\" alt=\"img_0919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0922.jpg\" alt=\"img_0922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/grescaaldruidaambromericervesaisabeer/img_0924.jpg\" alt=\"img_0924\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"ht